            "block_content": "24-6 During an election and petitioning campaign, JCEA's rights will be limited to those afforded all competing organiza-tions, as specified in Board Policy and Procedure Section HG, Methods of Recognizing Staff Negotiating Organizations, as in effect on the date of this Agreement, except for the purpose of administering the current collective bargaining agreement.",
